                    <p>京东【宝威玛旗舰店】</p><p>宝威玛今日支持京东 1 件 5 折 + 政府补贴双重优惠，全场直降闭眼囤好价，皆支持 <strong>30 天免费使用。</strong></p><p>保温饭盒平时可以用来带饭，外面的保温桶在出游时，可以用来装冰块 / 冰酒 / 冰可乐，非常方便。</p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p>先领 1 件 5 折平台券：<a href="https://coupon.m.jd.com/coupons/show.action?linkKey=AAROH_xIpeffAs_-naABEFoe2V1ILvOpBwL8SUdIjiIePp4z8MMWsdRvnpcKNFeOca66NE_ZEA-vA_mbBBb8Xa7DpuMrSg" target="_blank"><strong>点此领券</strong></a></p></li><li><p>再领 1 件 5 折备用券：<a href="https://coupon.m.jd.com/coupons/show.action?linkKey=AAROH_xIpeffAs_-naABEFoeSZ2UCRIvRIwO_aErxIlshb-vInIOJvUGhGaX_1aYmCmoG9HCQ8t-jQBR_Vzn-AZ5goR4ZA" target="_blank"><strong>点此领券</strong></a></p></li></ul><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/k6P6SnA" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/182028/21/31040/68535/64f53aa1F4bfe0a30/d0172ce231173103.jpg" title="129 → 36 元国补新低：宝威玛 316L 不锈钢焖烧壶直降，支持 30 天免费试用" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">宝威玛 316L 不锈钢焖烧壶</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 520ml 赠保温袋 + 勺子</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 129 → 36 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/kDPgP8d" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/509273/33/1375/196147/6a844619F1d6551ab/08ee3203205f4006.png" title="129 → 36 元国补新低：宝威玛 316L 不锈钢焖烧壶直降，支持 30 天免费试用" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">宝威玛 学生保温饭盒</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 316L 不锈钢 3 层 2.5L</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">379 → 106 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><dir><a contenteditable="false" href